WEBVTT

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.820
Our story, which began with the Zonderian invasion of Earth...

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.700
...has left many questions unanswered thus far.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.820
The young boy, Mamoru, who arrived here along with Galeon...

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.870
A boy blessed with the ability to both sense and Purify Zonders...

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.460
But where did he come from?

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:27.710
Also, the G-Stone, which gave Gai a new lease on life...

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.800
...and which has the opposite power of the Zonder metal...

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.010
Just what is this unlimited information circuit?

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.260
The robot who arrived in Japan from the US, Mic Sounders the 13th...

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.270
Just what is his true purpose?

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:42.060
Last but not least...

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:45.060
My Four Machine Kings...

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:49.860
At last the time has come for you all to show your full potential.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.990
I have high expectations of you!

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:56.150
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:59.050
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.790
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:10.050
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:16.770
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:21.050
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:25.970
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:29.890
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:32.690
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:36.450
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:41.450
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:44.620
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:47.160
Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:50.290
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.250
Warping dimensional space!

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:57.330
Dividing Driver!

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:04.970
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:10.850
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:13.800
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.690
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.570
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.910
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:25.120
The Great Annihilation of Tokyo!

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.370
<i>The Great Annihilation of Tokyo!</i>

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.170
Waha!

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.260
All right, boys and girls, pay attention, please!

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.760
From here on in, we move as a group.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:47.810
You're to stay with me at all times, understood?

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.640
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.700
Hey, it really is gigantic, huh? Tokyo Tower...

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:03.490
Huh?

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:06.040
What was that? It's different this time.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.830
I've got a really bad feeling.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.670
Is something the matter, Mamoru?

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.330
Huh? Um, no!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.380
I just got a little car sick, that's all!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.970
Come on! Why's it taking so long?

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:22.050
I've been to the top of the Eiffel Tower in <i>Paris</i> plenty of times...

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.300
...but never to the top of the Tokyo Tower!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:28.270
Pooh, the Eiffel Tower's only 320 meters tall, right?

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:32.520
Not only have I been to the top of the Sears Tower in Chicago...

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.860
...which is 443 meters tall...

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.730
...but I've also gone to the top of Mt. Everest in a helicopter...

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:40.110
...and that's 27 times as tall as the Eiffel Tower!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:49.120
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.120
Oh, come on! Open your eyes, Hana!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:54.170
This is nothing. Compared to Everest, we're way close to the ground!

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:58.170
Was that just my imagination? That feeling of dread?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.920
What's going on, Mamoru? You seem kinda down.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.720
Hey, you gotta take a dump?

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.890
No, I don't!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.520
Such a sublime sight, as always.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:13.350
Now then...

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:17.940
Shall we set off on our never-ending journey with no terminal station?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.110
Prepare to depart!

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.130
The scent of exhaust fumes is so divine!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.970
And the hum of that engine sets my spirit at ease.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.810
There's nothing like it!

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.020
Now, then, all of you, it's time to dance!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.730
Time to dance with yours truly...

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.650
Ready to depart!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:25.800
The Hyper Sonic Transport or HST...

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.510
An impressive effort by the Earthlings!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.390
It's a good match for this blue sky.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.270
We have liftoff!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:47.820
A Zonderian!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.870
Is he after Special Agent Mamoru?

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.330
Holographic Camouflage!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:06.970
Where are you, Zonderian?

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.140
I've found him!

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.070
He's at the entrance to Line 15 of the subway.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:26.570
Currently abandoned while the transit authority reorganizes...

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.340
Whoa! What the heck is that!

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:47.590
It reminds me of the aurora borealis that I saw in Alaska!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.640
It reminds <i>me</i> of the rainbow I saw in the Guiana Highlands!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.350
Don't tell me it's a Zonder!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.180
But, I'm not picking anything up.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.480
I don't know what it is, but all I'm getting is a bad premonition!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:17.040
This is the elevator going up to the Special Observation Deck!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.710
The elevators going down are one floor below you!

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.830
You cannot descend from this level!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.460
Boys and girls from Kamome Elementary School No. 1!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:26.880
Hurry, I need you all here now!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.050
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:29.880
Okay!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.640
It's jammed?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.180
Then it's a Zonder causing all this after all.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.010
Or maybe it's...

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.520
...a Zonderian!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.780
The elevators are not functioning at this time!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.080
Please use the stairs to descend!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.540
The elevators are not functioning!

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:13.630
Boys and girls! Go back to the observation deck!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.010
But this is...

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:18.260
...a Zonder Metal Plant!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.900
The Tokyo Water Vein M-7 Underground Aqueduct.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:35.450
The Zonderians... What are they plotting down here?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.880
This will be your final resting place!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.460
O Purple Robot!

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.340
So this was just a ploy to lure me here!

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.220
One must get rid of nuisances like you!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.480
System Change!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:08.230
Volfogg!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:10.980
Jet Wapper!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.000
So I surfaced in Tokyo Bay...

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.340
GunGlue!

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:37.430
Begin ascent!

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.600
Where did that Zonderian go?

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.180
What's that?

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.150
Is that Tokyo?

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.820
What on earth is going on?

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:58.660
This frigate belongs to me now.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.420
People! We have a crisis on our hands!

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.970
10 million civilians are trapped...

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.100
...inside that massive dome of light!

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.390
On land, in the air, below ground...

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.680
They've been completely cut off from the outside!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:30.190
You mean we never got an alert from Mamoru about sensing this Zonder?

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.650
He's off on a field trip to the Tokyo Tower today.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.820
Meaning he's trapped inside that dome as well.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.950
There's a tremendous jamming force...

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.490
...cutting off all communications from within the dome!

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:43.780
As for Elementary Particle Z0, we're not picking up any traces whatsoever.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.410
Volfogg!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.080
Weren't you supposed to be guarding Mamoru?

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:49.750
Forgive me.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.630
I fell for the enemy's maneuver...

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.750
...and was lured away from Special Agent Mamoru's side.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.420
Oh! I'm so worried about Mamoru and the others!

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.010
This time around, for the first time in GGG history...

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.300
...there's no question that we will be waging all-out warfare.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.510
For that reason, I've asked the Mobile Unit, the Intelligence Unit...

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.520
...the Tool Robots, and Mic to gather here today.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:13.020
I want you all up to speed and to make sure that there will be...

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.650
...no missteps in the strategy we're about to carry out!

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:19.490
I'm going to screen the images Volfogg brought back with him.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.200
That is a Self-Defense Force spy plane.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.910
Just wait till you see what comes next.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:26.790
What's that?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.410
We're going to take a frame-by-frame look at the flight camera video.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.880
The analysis shows that...

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.510
...it's some kind of flying vessel emitting tremendous shockwaves.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.470
It appears to be a Zonder that's taken a HST plane...

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.970
...from Haneda Airport as its host.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.270
However, I still wasn't able to detect any traces of Elementary Particle Z0.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.690
But if it's not a Zonder, then what could it possibly be?

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.150
I'm going to blow up the image.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:58.980
It's one of the Four Machine Kings, Pizza!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:02.820
Apparently, this battle is being fought by the Zonderians themselves.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.240
Until now, they've appeared before mankind in human form...

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:08.620
...transforming people into Zonder hosts, but...

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.200
...now they've shown up for real.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.790
I'll never forget that day, Zonderians!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.880
When you appeared inside the Particle Accelerator, Isolde...

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.420
Such a strange sight!

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:30.980
The Zonderians came in direct contact with our A.I. Systems.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.770
To tell us that they were highly sophisticated human-machine hybrids.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:39.070
Not only are the Zonderians going on the attack personally this time...

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:43.240
...but they're also fusing with other machines, turning into giant robots.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.620
The Self-Defense Force plane has also been taken over.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.700
This will prevent us from getting too close to them.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:53.080
If the Zonderians have joined the battle to go for a direct assault...

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.790
...then we're going to have our hands full.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.250
This is footage of what happened...

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.670
...when the Self-Defense Force tanks approached that dome.

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.340
What the heck does this mean?

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:06.050
The complex movements of the high-energy particles...

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:07.590
...are pushing up the surrounding air.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:11.470
Moreover, they're causing structural breakdown of any molecular bonds.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:15.310
We've named it the "Contra Fall" for the way the particles are moving.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.690
This energy barrier is comprised of four different layers.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.730
Our analysis has revealed...

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:23.400
...that we've encountered this very same phenomenon in the past.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:28.160
The first layer is the same thing that gave the Mobile Unit so much trouble...

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.490
...at the Isolde Particle Accelerator. A super-electromagnetic barrier.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:34.580
Needless to say, the energy level is considerably greater this time.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:39.170
The second layer is a protective film filled with condensed oxygen.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.000
With the same composition of that Zonder Cloud from before?

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.420
Meaning the instant we attack, there'll be a massive explosion?

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:55.520
The third layer is like the hyper-pod that trapped GaoGaiGar in Osaka.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.440
That was a tough one.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.400
Broken Magnum!

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.360
I couldn't find a way out, try as I might.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.610
And it was tough from the outside as well.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.990
It was impossible to enter.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.370
I guess our only option is to have the Pliers do what they can.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.210
And finally, the fourth layer.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.960
The same thing as the earth-bound sun created by the Micro-Zonders...

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.380
...the Grand Nova!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.590
Are Mamoru and the others safe, trapped inside that thing?

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:31.140
Since the temperature inside the Contra Fall appears to be...

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.640
...quite close to normal range, they should be fine, but...

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:37.060
If the interior temperature isn't very high, then that means...

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:41.480
...they must be building a Zonder Metal Plant inside!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.070
Are they actually planning to Zonderize 10 million civilians?

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.990
We've got to stop them, no matter what!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.610
I'm going to explain the operation now.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:55.290
GaoGaiGar, Goldymarg, ChoRyuJin and the Pliers will be working in sync...

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.540
...to breach the Contra Fall.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.620
We're going to hit the first layer with the Eraser Head.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.880
The vibrations will dispel its magnetic waves.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:07.590
For the second layer, we're going to open a hole with the Dividing Driver...

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.930
For the third layer, we'll use the Pliers to cut through the dimension itself.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.010
And for the fourth layer...

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.180
...we're going to convert the particles into light with the Goldion Hammer.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:18.180
And Mic, we're going to need you to distract the flying Zonderian.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.520
Okay! Okay! I'm ready for anything!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.270
Volfogg and the GunMachines...

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:27.070
Your job is to divert the Zonderian who's fused with the frigate.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:28.070
Understood.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.990
This goes for all of the layers, but there will only be a few seconds...

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:34.370
...to partially destroy the high-energy mass.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.410
It has to be done in a matter of seconds, huh?

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.620
Before the hole in the barrier closes up...

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.210
...we're going to have the Mobile Unit infiltrate the Contra Fall.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.380
Gotcha. I guess we're just gonna have to do it.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.550
We're gonna rescue Mamoru and the others no matter what!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:51.720
The point where the energy levels are the lowest is in the Hatsudai area.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:52.930
It'll be your point of infiltration.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.140
All right, then!

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.390
The lives of those 10 million civilians are in your hands!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:01.560
I'm counting on you! The most powerful robot brigade on earth!

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.100
Roger!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.980
Triple-decked Flying Carrier, ready for launch!

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:09.110
All crew members are to report to their positions at once!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:22.440
The red one's made of raging fire.

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:27.910
And he'll make the villains pay for sure.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:34.330
His heart full of justice is burning hot!

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:40.070
The blue one's cool and amazing.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:45.380
He's got the power to freeze the enemy in their tracks.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:52.110
There's a hidden anger inside of him!

00:16:54.810 --> 00:17:00.390
As long as courage still exists in this world...

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:06.630
...our comrades will live eternally!

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:09.310
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:12.100
Gi! Gi! Gi! Gi! Gi!

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:15.410
Those mecha bodies!

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.810
Gan, gan, gan, ga-gan!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:26.170
Fight on, you Brave Robot Brigade!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.690
System Change!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:40.810
The orange one's the big guy.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.370
Goldytank!

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:46.270
The power flows from his hammer.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:46.080
Baribarien... On!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:52.960
He's a tank that can make your soul tremble!

00:17:56.080 --> 00:18:00.880
The one who conceals himself in a purple mist...

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:02.720
Hang on till we get there, Special Agent Mamoru!

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:06.510
...can race through the dark night in a flash.

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:12.510
His eyes can find the hidden truth!

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:18.360
As long as courage still exists in this world...

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:24.960
...they're going to protect our happiness!

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:27.220
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.000
What!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:30.060
Gi! Gi! Gi! Gi! Gi!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.920
Darn, I was sure I'd get it right today!

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:33.610
Those mecha bodies!

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:35.910
Gan, gan, gan, ga-gan!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:44.880
Fight on, you Brave Robot Brigade!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:42.510
Symmetrical Docking!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:44.470
GunMachines, gather round!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:54.400
GaoGaiGar!

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:01.490
ChoRyuJin!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:08.330
Volfogg!

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:12.420
The enemy's coming, right?

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.960
And I'm gonna stop him, right?

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:18.170
System Change!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:20.260
Oops...

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.050
I still can't transform!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.640
What have I got to lose now?

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:28.140
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.180
Out of my way!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:34.520
Now you're in big trouble!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:43.490
What are you waiting for? Use that Eraser Head, for crying out loud!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:47.120
Roger! Eraser Head Tool, launch!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:51.540
We've pierced the first layer of the Contra Fall!

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.540
It's going to regenerate any second now!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.380
Are they firing on us from below?

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:07.390
I won't let them stand in our way!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:08.890
Three Become One!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:20.110
You're not going to escape this time!

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.860
You and I are going to thrash this out till the end!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.780
I wouldn't have it any other way.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:27.950
Now's my chance to get rid of you once and for all!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.960
Dividing Driver!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.710
We've penetrated the second layer!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.510
Okay! Take it away, Pliers!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:46.550
Get the heck out of my way!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.890
Dimension Pliers!

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:54.900
Tool Connect!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.740
We've broken through the third layer, but we're out of time!

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.740
All right! It's my turn now!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.080
No!

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.470
Sorry, Pliers!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:27.180
I owe you guys big time!

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:31.060
Hammer Connect!

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:39.440
Goldion Hammer!

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.450
Don't worry, I've got you covered!

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.910
All right!

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:52.830
We've penetrated the fourth layer!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.910
GaoGaiGar has infiltrated the Contra Fall!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:02.590
The whole city of Tokyo... is protruding from the ground!

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:14.470
What's going on?

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:48.150
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:52.570
At last, the Great Tokyo Battle for mankind's survival has begun.

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:53.990
Combat at the speed of sound...

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.660
...GaoGaiGar vs. Pizza!

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:57.790
A deadly struggle in the underground water vein...

00:23:57.910 --> 00:23:59.540
...Volfogg vs. Penchinon!

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:03.420
A full-power collision, ChoRyuJin vs. Polonaise and Primarda!

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:06.130
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.300
"Collision! The Four Machine Kings"

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:06.670
Collision! The Four Machine Kings

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:11.880
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.430
Disc X

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:14.890
This is the Key to Victory!
